# Line endings are part of this repo's contract, not a preference.
#
# GitHub's windows-latest runner checks out with core.autocrlf=true.  Without
# this file that rewrites, on checkout only:
#   - docker/*/entrypoint.sh, which the entrypoint tests EXECUTE under bash;
#     CRLF makes the shell read `fi\r` and the sliced guard regions never run,
#     so the git spy records no calls and the tests fail on Windows only.
#   - bench/samples/*.json, which tests/bench/test_runner.py asserts is LF.
#
# Normalize everything text-like to LF in the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.db binary
